    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even that i want help finding the switches. that's the part that hurts. i've spent so much time looking for them, and the rooms just keep getting darker anyway. it feels less like i'm losing something and more like the house is just... finally deciding it's done. it feels almost more peaceful to just let the last one go than to keep stumbling around in the dark.",
